Package: dcc
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: personne-admin <personneadmin@protonmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Personne-admin/dcc
Description: Compiler for the dc systems programming language
 dc is a small systems language, built with a freestanding-first
 mindset.
 .
 This package contains the dcc compiler, the dccd language server,
 the dcdoc documentation generator and the libdcext library for
 Linux (LLVM and native backends).
